#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:1
msgid "MSVC prerequisites"
msgstr "MSVC 前置条件"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:3
msgid ""
"To compile programs into an exe file, Rust requires a linker, libraries and "
"Windows API import libraries. For `msvc` targets these can be acquired "
"through Visual Studio."
msgstr ""
"若要将程序编译为exe 文件，Rust 需要链接、库和 Windows API 导入库。 对于`msvc`"
"目标，这些可以通过 Visual Studio 获得。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:6
msgid "Automatic install"
msgstr "自动安装"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:8
msgid ""
"If you don't have Visual Studio already installed then [rustup-init](https://"
"rustup.rs) will offer to automatically install the prerequisites. Doing so "
"means you can skip the rest of this page. However, it installs Visual Studio "
"Community edition which may not be appropriate for all users. It is free for "
"individuals, academic and open source use, but not for other uses, such as "
"in proprietary enterprise software. Users should ask their organisation "
"which edition is right for them. See [licensing terms](https://visualstudio."
"microsoft.com/license-terms/) for more details."
msgstr ""
"如果您尚未安装 Visual Studio，那么 [rustup-init](https://rustup.rs) 将自动安"
"装先决条件。 这意味着您可以跳过此页面的其余部分。 然而，它安装了可能不适合所"
"有用户的 Visual Studio 社区版本。 它对个人、学术界和开放源码的使用是免费的，"
"但对其他用途，如专利企业软件则是免费的。 用户应该询问他们组织哪个版本对他们是"
"正确的。详情请参阅[许可证条款](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/license-"
"terms/)。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:15
msgid "WinGet"
msgstr "WinGet"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:17
msgid ""
"Alternatively Visual Studio can be installed via the [WinGet](https://learn."
"microsoft.com/en-us/windows/package-manager/winget/) package manager, which "
"should be available by default on recent versions of Windows. Run the "
"following command in powershell or the command prompt:"
msgstr ""
"或者，可以通过[WinGet](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/package-"
"manager/winget/)包管理器来安装Visual Studio，这一工具在最新版本的Windows系统"
"中应该是默认可用的。在PowerShell或命令提示符中运行以下命令："

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:20
msgid ""
"```\n"
"winget install --id Microsoft.VisualStudio.2022.Community --source winget --"
"force --override \"--add Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64 --"
"add Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.ARM64 --add Microsoft."
"VisualStudio.Component.Windows11SDK.22621 --addProductLang En-us\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```\n"
"winget install --id Microsoft.VisualStudio.2022.Community --source winget --"
"force --override \"--add Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.x86.x64 --"
"add Microsoft.VisualStudio.Component.VC.Tools.ARM64 --add Microsoft."
"VisualStudio.Component.Windows11SDK.22621 --addProductLang En-us\"\n"
"```"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:24
msgid ""
"You can replace \"Community\" with \"BuildTools\" in the above command if "
"you already have a Visual Studio license."
msgstr ""
"如果你已经拥有 Visual Studio 的许可证，可以在上述命令中将“Community”替换"
"为“BuildTools”。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:26
msgid "Missing Windows SDK"
msgstr "缺少Windows SDK"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:28
msgid ""
"If after running the above command the Windows 11 SDK is missing then you "
"may need to manually install it, which can also be done via WinGet. First "
"search for the available versions:"
msgstr ""
"如果运行上述命令后，Windows 11 SDK仍然缺失，那么您可能需要手动安装它。这一操"
"作也可以通过WinGet来完成。首先，请搜索可用的版本。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:35
msgid "This should display a table of results. that will look like this:"
msgstr "这应该会显示一个结果表格，看起来就像这样："

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:45
msgid ""
"Pick the Id with the latest version and install that via `winget install`. "
"For example, to install `Microsoft.WindowsSDK.10.0.26100` run:"
msgstr ""
"请选择最新版本的Id，并通过 `winget install` 进行安装。例如，要安装 "
"`Microsoft.WindowsSDK.10.0.26100`，请执行以下操作："

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:54
msgid "Manual install"
msgstr "手动安装"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:56
msgid ""
"[Download Visual Studio](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/). "
"Rust supports Visual Studio 2017 and later but it is recommended that you "
"use the latest version (currently 2022) for new projects. You can opt to "
"download only the Build Tools for Visual Studio, which does not include the "
"IDE. However this requires you already have a license to the Community, "
"Professional or Enterprise edition."
msgstr ""
"[下载 Visual Studio](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/)。 Rust 支"
"持 Visual Studio 2017 及更高版本，但建议您使用最新版本 (当前为2022) 进行新项"
"目。 您可以选择仅下载不包含 IDE 的 Visual Studio 构建工具。 然而，这需要您已"
"经拥有社区、专业或企业版本的许可证。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:61
msgid ""
"Once you've downloaded and started the installer, the easiest way to get "
"everything installed is to select \"Desktop Development with C++\". This "
"will include the necessary components. On the \"Language Packs\" tab, make "
"sure the English language pack is installed in addition to your preferred "
"language."
msgstr ""
"一旦你下载并开始安装，所有安装的最简单的方法是选择\"桌面开发C++\"。 这将包含"
"必要的组件。在“语言包”选项卡中，请确保除了您的首选语言外，还安装了英语包。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:65
msgid ""
"If you want more details on the installation process or want to further "
"customize the install then follow the walkthrough below. Otherwise complete "
"the Visual Studio install and continue with installing Rust."
msgstr ""
"如果您想要安装过程的更多详细信息，或想要进一步定制安装，请跟随下面的步行。 否"
"则请安装 Visual Studio 并继续安装 Rust。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:68
msgid "Walkthrough: Installing Visual Studio 2022"
msgstr "安装 Visual Studio 2022 的教程"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:70
msgid ""
"This walkthrough uses the Community edition of Visual Studio but the "
"Professional, Enterprise and the Build Tools all work the same way."
msgstr ""
"此演示使用的是 Visual Studio 的社区版，不过 Professional、Enterprise 以及 "
"Build Tools 版本的功能都是相同的。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:72
msgid ""
"The installer will start by linking to the [license](https://visualstudio."
"microsoft.com/license-terms/) and for your edition of Visual Studio and then "
"preparing the installer."
msgstr ""
"安装程序将通过链接到 [license](https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/license-"
"terms/)以及您的 Visual Studio 版本，然后准备安装程序。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:74
msgid ""
"![Accept the license](images/step1.png) ![Installing the installer](images/"
"step2.png)"
msgstr "![接受许可](images/step1.png) ![安装安装](images/step2.png)"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:77
msgid ""
"Once this finishes, you can then select the components to be installed. Here "
"we use the \"Workload\" tab to select the \"Desktop Development with C++\" "
"workload. This will includes all needed components for Rust: ![Select the C+"
"+ Workload](images/step3.png)"
msgstr ""
"完成这些步骤后，您可以选择要安装的组件。在这里，我们使用“Workload”选项卡来选"
"择“Desktop Development with C++”工作负载。这将包含所有所需的Rust组件：![选择"
"C++工作负载](images/step3.png)"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:82
msgid "Installing only the required components (optional)"
msgstr "仅安装所需的组件（可选）"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:84
msgid ""
"If you'd like a more minimal install (and won't be doing C++ development) "
"then you can use the \"Individual Components\" tab to select just the "
"essentials, which are:"
msgstr ""
"如果您希望采用更精简的安装方式（并且不需要进行C++开发），那么可以使用“单个组"
"件”选项卡来仅选择必要的组件，这些组件包括："

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:86
msgid "MSVC v143 - VS 2022 C++ x64/x86 build tools (Latest)"
msgstr ""
"MSVC v143 - VS 2022 C++ x64/x86 构建工具(Latet)MSVC v143 - VS 2022 C++ 64 "
"位/86 位构建工具（旧版本）"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:87
msgid "Windows 11 SDK (10.0.22621.0)"
msgstr "Windows 11 SDK (10.0.22621.0)Windows 11 SDK（10.0.22621.0）"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:89
msgid ""
"Note that the specific version of the Windows SDK doesn't matter for pure "
"Rust code but if using C++ as well you'll likely want either the latest or "
"whichever version is required by the C++ project (or both)."
msgstr ""
"请注意，对于纯Rust代码来说，Windows SDK的具体版本并不重要，但如果你同时使用C+"
"+语言，那么你可能需要使用最新版本的Windows SDK，或者至少是C++项目所要求的那个"
"版本（或者两者都需要）。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:91
msgid ""
"![Select the latest MSVC component](images/component-msvc.png) ![Select the "
"Windows 11 SDK component](images/component-sdk.png)"
msgstr ""
"![选择最新的 MSVC 组件](images/component-msvc.png) ![选择Windows 11 SDK 组件]"
"(images/component-sdk.png)  "

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:94
msgid "Adding Language Packs (optional)"
msgstr "添加语言包(可选)"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:96
msgid ""
"After choosing the components, you may also want to select the language "
"packs to install. Switch to the \"Language Packs\" tab and add the "
"languages. It is recommended that you add the English language pack in "
"addition to your preferred language. This will provide English language "
"error messages, which may help when reporting errors."
msgstr ""
"在选择组件后，您也可能想要选择要安装的语言包。切换到“语言包”选项卡并添加语"
"言。 建议您在首选语言之外添加英语包。 这将提供英文错误消息，这可能有助于报告"
"错误。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:101
msgid "![Add the English language](images/step4.png)"
msgstr "![添加英文](images/step4.png)"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:103
msgid "Completing the install"
msgstr "完成安装"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:105
msgid ""
"Finally click the install button and wait for everything to be installed."
msgstr "最后单击安装按钮，等待安装一切。"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:107
msgid "![Wait for the install to complete](images/step5.png)"
msgstr "![等待安装完成](images/step5.png)"

#: src/installation/windows-msvc.md:109
msgid "Once finished, you can continue on to installing Rust."
msgstr "完成后，您可以继续安装 Rust。"
